build/
build-*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Scratch output location for the documented demo / reproduction commands.
out/
# Retained matrix evidence is pruned to keep the repository small:
# decision/rx logs are kept only for seed 101 of the two walkthrough
# scenarios, and overload event ledgers only for seed 101. `make matrix`
# regenerates the pruned deterministic CSV files (inputs, summary.csv,
# events.csv, state.csv, decisions.csv, rx.csv) byte-identically; the
# deterministic files are exactly those whose sha256 is listed in
# results/matrix/manifest.json. runtime.txt holds host timing and is NOT
# deterministic; it and other timing/path/git-state metadata are outside
# the byte-identity claim.
results/matrix/runs/**/decisions.csv
results/matrix/runs/**/rx.csv
results/matrix/runs/**/runtime.txt
!results/matrix/runs/alarm_outage/seed101/*/decisions.csv
!results/matrix/runs/alarm_outage/seed101/*/rx.csv
!results/matrix/runs/tight_deadline/seed101/*/decisions.csv
!results/matrix/runs/tight_deadline/seed101/*/rx.csv
results/matrix/runs/overload/seed10[2-5]/*/events.csv
results/matrix/checks/**/runtime.txt
